{"name":"Annatto","hex":"#8c5341","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"annatto","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A tropical American evergreen shrub, Bixa orellana; the lipstick tree; the fruit of the tree.","The seed of this tree used as a colouring or in Latin American cooking, containing bixin."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/annatto"}],"entries":[{"title":"Annatto","blocks":[{"text":"Annatto is an orange-red condiment and food coloring derived from the seeds of the achiote tree, native to tropical parts of the Americas. It is used to impart a yellow to red-orange color to foods, but may impart a sweet, peppery flavor."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Bixa_orellana_fruit_open.jpg/330px-Bixa_orellana_fruit_open.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Annatto","wikidata":"Q425902"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Tsachila.jpg/500px-Tsachila.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Tsachila.jpg/1280px-Tsachila.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Tsachila.jpg/500px-Tsachila.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Tsáchila man, with his hair colored with annatto","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATsachila.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Colby_Cheese.jpg/500px-Colby_Cheese.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Colby_Cheese.jpg/1280px-Colby_Cheese.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1